msgid ""
"Actioneer Help\n"
"\n"
"Getting started\n"
"1. Sign in with your GitHub account on the welcome screen.\n"
"2. Pick a repository in the left sidebar.\n"
"3. Expand a workflow to inspect recent runs.\n"
"\n"
"Useful actions\n"
"- Refresh repository/workflow status with F5.\n"
"- Trigger manual workflow runs from the play button.\n"
"- Open Preferences with Ctrl+, to adjust refresh/notifications.\n"
"- Open Keyboard Shortcuts with Ctrl+? for quick references.\n"
"\n"
"Troubleshooting\n"
"- If no repos appear, verify your token and network access.\n"
"- For expired logs, retry from the latest run or trigger a new run.\n"
"- Use Report Issue from the menu to send diagnostics and steps."
msgstr "Actioneer 帮助\n\n入门\n1. 在欢迎界面使用你的 GitHub 账号登录。\n2. 在左侧边栏选择一个仓库。\n3. 展开一个工作流以查看最近的运行。\n\n常用操作\n- 按 F5 刷新仓库/工作流状态。\n- 使用播放按钮手动触发工作流运行。\n- 按 Ctrl+, 打开“首选项”以调整刷新/通知设置。\n- 按 Ctrl+? 打开“键盘快捷键”查看快速参考。\n\n故障排查\n- 如果没有显示仓库，请检查你的令牌和网络访问。\n- 对于已过期的日志，请从最新运行重试或触发一次新的运行。\n- 使用菜单中的“报告问题”发送诊断信息和复现步骤。"

msgid "Need more help? Use “Report Issue” in the app menu or visit:"
msgstr "还需要帮助？请在应用菜单中使用“报告问题”或访问："

